BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Writing Class (Paid Program) @ SMB Studio (Main Level)
DTSTART:20261105T170000Z
DTEND:20261105T183000Z
DTSTAMP:20261030T153203Z
UID:greendale-thursday-november-5-2026-1200pm-130pm-writing-class-paid-pro
 gram@ymcaofcm-7023
CATEGORIES:Group Exercise
DESCRIPTION:Category: Group Exercise\nStudio: SMB Studio (Main Level)\nThe
  Y is excited to launch Free Writes! program. These are regular meet-up ti
 mes where we have the opportunity to write together\, share\, give feedbac
 k\, and become part of a writing community. This is a low-cost\, no-expect
 ation and low-pressure opportunity. Join us if you are a beginner\; join u
 s if you are trying to begin again\; or join us if you are well on your wa
 y already. We'll write for an hour and allow the final half hour for anyon
 e who wants to hear others' works or share their own. Sensing that we have
  something to express is an important beginning to realizing our creative 
 potential. Finding the time to release it to the world through channels of
  creative expression can often be a challenging second step. And being abl
 e to shape that release in the midst of supportive fellow writers? That is
  truly a gift that is hard to come by. Come and find your voice in the mid
 st of other Central MA writers. We can't wait to meet you and to honor and
  celebrate the voices within each of us just waiting to emerge! For pricin
 g and more info: https://operations.daxko.com/Online/5104/ProgramsV2/Searc
 h.mvc?category_ids=TAG23002&location_ids%5B0%5D=B368 Classes run every ses
 sion which lasts about 6-8 weeks\, please click here for Registration Link
  . For more info on when registration opens\, click here . Look for "Sessi
 on Dates".\nBranch: Greendale Family Branch
LOCATION:SMB Studio (Main Level)\, Greendale Family Branch\, 75 Shore Dr\,
  Worcester\, MA 01605
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
